var builtinDocs = map[string]string{
	"code-risk":       "# Code risk\n\nA file-level scout, not an application audit. Use the risk probability to choose what to read next. The maintainability score describes levels, not a measured quantity.\n\nStart with five files, inspect the evidence, then run the tree. Set `focus` to your concern. Do not route actions on unmeasured cutoffs.\n",
	"ticket-routing":  "# Ticket routing\n\nChoose one queue and retain its probability distribution. The other queue is explicit. Edit the taxonomy for your team before routing real work.\n",
	"receipt-quality": "# Receipt quality\n\nUse the Cloudflare provider with Clef or Clef-flash. Each image is one item. Both questions are judgments; unreadable receipts should be reviewed by a person. No remote image URL is sent to the model.\n",
	"relevance":       "# Relevance\n\nAsk about a topic, retain evidence, then rank or pack the saved results. The sample question is illustrative; replace it with your task.\n",
}

